	(text "The TPS61169 WLED (White LED) driver is a boost converter\nregulated in current through FB pin. The driver uses a 204mV\nvoltage reference and the resistor on FB pin set the current\nthreshold -> 204mV / 1.5 ohm = 136 mA. To have full brightness on\n5\" Riverdi screen, 140 mA are needed. To control the brightness,\na PWM signal is injected on CTRL pin. 100% duty cycle is full\nbrightness, 50% half brightness and so on ... "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 65.024 151.892 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "cfe45cf6-ecda-493b-8fec-6089e8f9d3d2")
	)
